"""Russian texts of the user interface (``ru``), one per key of :data:`jsonreshape.i18n.MESSAGES`.

Generated from the English texts (stage 7) and kept in this separate module so that ``i18n.py`` stays the
two-language source of truth (``uz`` primary, ``en`` fallback; tests require exactly those two there).
:func:`jsonreshape.i18n.t` looks a key up here when the language is ``ru`` and falls back to English for a
key that is missing, so new keys may land before their translation. ``tests/test_i18n_ru.py`` checks that
every key here exists in ``MESSAGES`` with the same placeholders and line breaks and that every key of
``MESSAGES`` has a Russian text here.
"""

